{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264CUIExvpcb1793309842.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國國防部長赫格塞思解僱一名陸軍中將，據報他涉嫌向傳媒洩露機密情報，內容涉及伊朗戰事。</p><p></p><p>國防部高級官員向CBS新聞表示，負責長遠軍事規劃的陸軍中將西爾維亞，涉嫌向傳媒洩露機密情報，內容涉及伊朗戰事及俄烏戰爭。國防部長赫格塞思以嚴重失當行為為由，解除他的職務。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.DISMISS-0500_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20268iLyCwy3FF1793309905.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>國防部官員透露西爾維亞三次未能通過測謊測試。調查人員在測試期間曾盤問他，有沒有向媒體洩露機密情報。不過針對他的指控尚未獲獨立證實。案件已轉交司法部處理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T22:21:33.655872+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":206,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T21:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T22:58:17.759297+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T22:18:20.383806+00:00","content_hash":"4a8aabda896b9a92262830a849ff324b083fe3a39264bc5259e053d8b0fb26b5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}